   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;en mars 2025 : 1) un soutien &#xe0; l&#x2019;inscription et &#xe0; la participation des femmes afghanes au programme acad&#xe9;mique de l&#x2019;Asian University for Women&#x2019;s, assurant les frais de scolarit&#xe9;, le logement et la nourriture, ainsi que d&#x2019;autres services de soutien qui les aident &#xe0; obtenir un dipl&#xf4;me universitaire reconnu; 2) un soutien &#xe0; la participation des femmes afghanes &#xe0; 93 activit&#xe9;s distinctes sur le campus li&#xe9;es &#xe0; l&#x2019;engagement communautaire et au d&#xe9;veloppement de carri&#xe8;re.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of March 2025 include: (1) supported the enrolment and participation of Afghan women in the Asian University for Women&#x2019;s academic program, ensuring tuition, room and board, and other support services that help them achieve a recognized university degree; and (2) supported the participation of Afghan women in 93 distinct campus activities relating to community engagement and career development.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent  : 1) am&#xe9;liorer la capacit&#xe9; des femmes afghanes &#xe0; appliquer l&#x2019;apprentissage de niveau acad&#xe9;mique dans leur carri&#xe8;re et leur vie; 2) accro&#xee;tre la repr&#xe9;sentation et le leadership des femmes afghanes dans les initiatives de d&#xe9;veloppement communautaire et de perfectionnement de carri&#xe8;re.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) increased Afghan women&#x2019;s ability to apply academic level learning in their careers and lives; and (2) increased representation and leadership by Afghan women in community and career development initiatives.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
